1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,340
A rancher finds shiny foil, rubber and sticks all over the ranch.

2
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:07,140
So the Army announces it's got a flying disc.

3
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:09,940
But hours later, it takes that back:

4
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:10,980
just a weather balloon.

5
00:00:11,190 --> 00:00:13,270
Thirty years later, people start saying:

6
00:00:13,590 --> 00:00:15,190
aliens, and a cover-up.

7
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:17,510
Turns out, there was a cover-up.

8
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:18,950
It really was a balloon.

9
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:20,470
Just not for weather.

10
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:24,300
A secret one, built to listen for Soviet nuclear bombs.
